to the running CPU, and the stats handler sums all CPUs via a helper.
The unsigned-int cast in the helper preserves the 32-bit wrap semantics
of atomic_read(), and the 64-bit sum keeps the displayed totals exact
for far longer than a single 32-bit counter on 24/7 systems.

